{%- comment -%}
A post's blurb: its `description` (which is also the feed summary and the
page's meta description), or else the start of its first paragraph.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if include.post.description -%}
  {{- include.post.description | strip_html | strip -}}
{%- else -%}
  {{- include.post.excerpt | strip_html | strip | truncate: 260 -}}
{%- endif -%}
